    "text": "StudioRecon reconstructs 4D human scenes from sparse, low-overlap cameras by decoupling background and humans.",
    "topic": "4D Human-Scene Reconstruction"
  },
  {
    "text": "StudioRecon initializes deformable Gaussian humans using cross-view identity association and triangulated multi-view keypoint fitting.",
    "topic": "Human Initialization"
  },
  {
    "text": "StudioRecon densifies background supervision by synthesizing hundreds of camera-controlled novel views with a video diffusion model.",
    "topic": "Background Densification"
  },
  {
    "text": "Camera intrinsics are vital for recovering 3D structure from 2D video.",
    "topic": "Camera Intrinsics"
  }
